"""P35 M5 scratch mutation runner (never committed as product code).

Each mutant: fresh `git archive HEAD` export, exact-once anchor edits, py_compile,
import-origin check, then the listed pytest nodes. KILLED only if pytest exits 1,
every listed node FAILED, no collection/import/syntax error occurred, and the
failures are assertion failures (assert / pytest.raises DID NOT RAISE).
"""

